          {
            "m_dialogTag": "Completion",
            "m_dialogEntries": [
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "DM-HOWL-NPC04E_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Have you found the Wolfsbane? That strange werewolf, not adorned like the others, is tracking you through the woods?",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Player_BranchBoss_C_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Runa_DM-HOWL_069.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1624416,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "DM-HOWL-NPC04E_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Hmm, could be a recent transformation, still struggling against the Curse.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Player_BranchBoss_C_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Runa_DM-HOWL_070.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1624416,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "DM-HOWL-NPC05A_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "One of the others must have snuck out while we weren't looking. But which one? All of you out at once!",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_OutsiderQueen_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Queen_Glorina_DM-HOWL_028.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1634675,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "DM-HOWL-NPC04E_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "We can safely rule out the two of us, as we were both here the whole time. But the remaining four, any one of them could have been out there, after you.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Player_BranchBoss_C_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Runa_DM-HOWL_071.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1624416,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "DM-HOWL-NPC04E_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "My cure will work on whoever is the Werewolf, but will incapacitate an ordinary human. And you still have Barghest to contend with.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Player_BranchBoss_C_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Runa_DM-HOWL_072.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1624416,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "DM-HOWL-NPC05A_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Aye. Any still standing would gladly aid you against the Lord of Coins. So choose carefully. Were there any signs of who was stalking you?",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_OutsiderQueen_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Queen_Glorina_DM-HOWL_029.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1634675,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "DM-HOWL-NPC04E_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
